------ USERS --------
	Access/modify users' data

	public user's data:		private user's data:
		- id					- email
		- username				- passwordHash
		- avatarFilename		- createdAt


	GET    users/
		list all users

	POST   users/
		create a new user,
				require a body with non-optionnal parameters of users table

	GET    users/search/
		(args in query -> users/search?query=TO_SEARCH&max=HOW_MANY)
			(tout ce qui suit '?' est la query HTTP, 'query' est un nom de variable custom, à ne pas confondre)
		get list of users where username match query

	----me---- : AccesToken required
		Interact with a specific user's data,

	GET    users/me/
		get user's public data

	DELETE users/me/
		delete user,
				require password in body

	PATCH  users/me/
		update user's data,
				new values in body, requires password for sensitive fields (ex: email)

	PATCH  users/me/avatar
		update user's avatar,
				file must be transmetted by multipart/form-data (Content-Type)

	DELETE users/me/avatar
		delete user's avatar



	GET    uploads/avatars/FILE_NAME
		get the avatar file,
				FILE_NAME is provided by public selection,
				No authentification is required for this


------ FRIENDS --------: AccessToken required
	Handle relationships

	Possible Relationship status:
		- PENDING
		- ACCEPTED
		- REJECTED
		- BLOCKED

	!!! (relationshipId != userId) !!!

	POST   friends/request/:id
		send friend request to user matching id

	POST   friends/accept/:id
		accept friend request matching id

	POST   friends/reject/:id
		reject friend request matching id

	POST   friends/block/:id
		block the user associated with the relationship matching id (relationshipId),
				a user can only block users who sent request or are already friends

	GET    friends/
		list all friends (ACCEPTED)

	GET    friends/pending/
		list all pending requests


------ CONVERSATIONS --------: AccessToken required
	Get user's conversations list and messages

	GET    conversations/
		Get conversations list

	GET    conversations/:id/messages
		Get 'limit' last messages from conversation matching id,
				'limit' must be provide by query (conversations/:id/messages?limit=20)
				(Je n'ai pas encore contrôler la variable limite, donc tu peux même mettre des valeurs incohérentes: -1, 9999999. Je ferai plus tard)

------ LOBBY --------: AccessToken required
	Handle lobbies

	POST   /
		Create a lobby, user will join it

	POST   /join
		Join lobby corresponding to lobbyId in body

	POST   /leave
		Leave user's current lobby

	POST   /eject
		Eject user corresponding to targetId in body
